  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrices such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is symmetric and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> are skew-symmetric.</p><p>Consider the statements</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup></math> is symmetric</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>26</mn></msup></math> is symmetric</p><p>Then,</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></math> is true",
      "is_correct": true
