    {
      "text": "Both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></math> are true",
